kings on past flights via the API or verify the Past tab displays correctly when populated. I see the issue—the seed data only has flights in April 2026, so I can't create past bookings without modifying the seed to include earlier departure dates. I need to either add past flights to the seed data or create them during test setup to make these test cases work.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":16147,"cache_read_input_tokens":37513,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":16147,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05923c41-2ea4-40be-b7d6-bb4c984a6ea5","uuid":"85ca98cc-8a37-4414-9e18-91c7f2ae31ae"}
